      "writtenOn": "2024-11-26T14:41:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, perhaps I was totally confused (and adding noise to the CL :\\). If the frontend validation will Just Work across the different backends (which makes sense), and the only difference is that we don\u0027t actually *exploit* the information that the developer is giving us for the other backends, then I agree that there\u0027s no reason not to just do the validation agnostic to the backend.\n\nAnd I agree with your summary of what `sampledTextureBinding` fundamentally is.",
      "parentUuid": "b8b3d570_3d665bba",
      "revId": "729d16fa67944981ad5bf7aeaffe73efd2982156",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
